ssroom which has children's toys inside.   2. A hole in the wall in the two-year old classroom which exposes cords from an outlet and sheetrock that is accessible to children.   3.A separate hole in the hallway next to the two-year old classroom.  4. Ceiling tiles coming out of the ceiling.  5. Baseboards in the portable for 3 year olds are coming up with nails exposed.  6. The floor in the portable for school-age children has a wooden plank covering the floor causing a tripping hazard.   7. A light cord in the school age portable being exposed and accessible to children.   8. A nail coming out of the wall in the 3 year old portable that is accessible to children.   9. The entrance door to the 3 year old portable has a quarter size hole above the lock.  10. The wooden floors in the 3 year old portable are spaced incorrectly causing a safety hazard.   11. The ceiling in the 3 year old portable has a plank like piece of wood that is dipping in the center.   12. The A/C for the 3 year old portable was at 79 degrees Fahrenheit.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026636436","violation_type_title":"Maintenance of Building, Grounds and Equipment (26 TAC §746.3407)","topic_label":"Safety hazards"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1338502-i20220513","date":"2022-05-13","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905835580","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905835580","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2022-05-13","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1338502-i20220502","date":"2022-05-02","inspection_type":"Investigation of a report (self-reported)","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905936470","url":"https